    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Fixes the physical shape of the repository so every later spec can name its territory unambiguously: a single root Cargo workspace (`crates/*` plus the Tauri app crate under `apps/desktop/src-tauri`), a single pnpm workspace (`apps/*`), pinned Rust and Node toolchains, edition 2024, a supply-chain policy (`deny.toml`), and the manifest metadata every package must carry so spec-spine discovers it and maps it to its owning spec. Owns the root manifests and co-owns the Makefile's build/test/lint targets with the harness spec. Establishes no product code.\n",
    "title": "Workspace layout: one Cargo workspace, one pnpm workspace, pinned toolchains"
